{"name": "Ribbit Rogue", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft a synergistic limited pool of<strong> dice</strong>\u00a0in this\u00a0<strong>deck-building, turn-based roguelike</strong> game where you fight to reclaim your swamp from the corruption that has overtaken it. Each die comes with six sides containing their own actions and abilities that pair together, along with powerful relics acquired during a run, in order to dish out some devastating attacks and combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"388\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/8af798db1fe8c7bb88792959e12e2204.poster.avif?t=1787537341\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/8af798db1fe8c7bb88792959e12e2204.webm?t=1787537341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/8af798db1fe8c7bb88792959e12e2204.mp4?t=1787537341\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build your  pool from a growing set of dice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategize which dice stay, and which ones go as you only have 10 slots available to you at once. Each die over unique ways to win in battle. Some may seem weak, but paired with the right dice or relics, all can find a way to be useful during your run making sure each one is unique and fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"466\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/adaef14c1daed55827edbc4559521f2b.poster.avif?t=1787537341\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/adaef14c1daed55827edbc4559521f2b.webm?t=1787537341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/adaef14c1daed55827edbc4559521f2b.mp4?t=1787537341\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forge your dice to your needs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If a die just isn't feeling strong enough forge it to upgrade different sides or even swap sides on two dice in order to create the perfect one to suit your current needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"486\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/df7722d60389ea476bbfa7d66f678260.poster.avif?t=1787537341\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/df7722d60389ea476bbfa7d66f678260.webm?t=1787537341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/df7722d60389ea476bbfa7d66f678260.mp4?t=1787537341\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the swamp</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover all that your homeland has in store for you, from dangerous traps to calm fishing holes and everything else in between. Maybe the inhabitants that aren't trying to thwart you can actually help you on your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/cbfc829e54edbe0cd2fe48ca74a72cef.poster.avif?t=1787537341\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/cbfc829e54edbe0cd2fe48ca74a72cef.webm?t=1787537341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/extras/cbfc829e54edbe0cd2fe48ca74a72cef.mp4?t=1787537341\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If all else fails, just hope luck is on your side</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Stop the corruption in this strategic turn based deck-builder roguelike. Collect and upgrade dice for your limited deck, discover powerful relics to create game breaking synergies, and navigate unique events on your way to the heart of the swamp.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947390/34aea0a82b2c3e52319782df2694a12d70ab009b/header.jpg?t=1787537341", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Card Battler", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Roguelite", "Dungeon Crawler", "Turn-Based", "Card Game"], "developers": "King Krab Games", "publishers": "King Krab Games", "release_date": "Sep 3, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3947390", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "20 February 2026 - Request Access\n\n9 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/vfswQ3_Qh2A", "first_seen": 1771542000.0, "review_rank": 1171}